            <title>0.8.4</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 14:37:21 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://hibiscus.page</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/RUGUX/hibiscus-releases/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>12</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Hibiscus 0.8.4 makes Quick Capture dependable in the background and adds native Finder import.

- ⌘⇧U can save notes even when the main Hibiscus window has never opened or has been closed.
- Capture save failures now show a readable message directly in the capture bar.
- Finder’s “Open With” menu now offers Hibiscus for supported text, Markdown, PDF, Word, and rich-text documents without changing the system default app.
- A new “Start Hibiscus at Login” menu option keeps Quick Capture ready from sign-in. ⌘Q still quits Hibiscus completely.
]]></description>
